BordyFallback.ttf placeholder

This file should be replaced with a small Chinese TrueType font (e.g. a subset of Noto Sans SC
or another open-source CJK font) before building the WeChat Mini Game.

Use the provided script:

    python3 tools/subset_font.py /path/to/NotoSansSC-Regular.otf \
        Assets/Bordy/StreamingAssets/BordyFallback.ttf

Then also copy it to Resources so Unity can load it natively:

    cp Assets/Bordy/StreamingAssets/BordyFallback.ttf \
       Assets/Bordy/Resources/Bordy/BordyUI.ttf

Do NOT commit commercial fonts (e.g. PingFang) to the repository.
